ield":null,"_gate_int_coverage":null,"_gp_int_coverage":null,"_score_int_coverage":null,"_gate_net_debt_ebitda":null,"_gp_net_debt_ebitda":null,"_score_net_debt_ebitda":null,"_gate_accruals":-0.04333006046603009,"_gp_accruals":true,"_score_accruals":80.5,"_gate_rev_volatility":0.06092971684026613,"_gp_rev_volatility":true,"_score_rev_volatility":96.9,"_gate_margin_vs_hist":0.06448771867608749,"_gp_margin_vs_hist":false,"_score_margin_vs_hist":19.4,"_gate_piotroski":5,"_gp_piotroski":false,"_score_piotroski":55.6,"_gate_spread":null,"_gp_spread":null,"_score_spread":null,"_gate_roic_consistency":null,"_gp_roic_consistency":null,"_score_roic_consistency":null,"_gate_incr_roic":null,"_gp_incr_roic":null,"_score_incr_roic":null,"_gate_margin_advantage":null,"_gp_margin_advantage":null,"_score_margin_advantage":null,"_gate_pool_share":0.12658846845495897,"_gp_pool_share":true,"_score_pool_share":90.6,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.008153366249123323,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":20.2,"_gate_share_shrink":0.03397734929724128,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":7.5,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.050446081204270646,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":15.9,"_gate_insider_own":0.0028900001,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":1.9,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Tradeweb Markets Inc. builds and operates electronic marketplaces in the United States and internationally. The company offers marketplaces that facilitate trading products across various asset classes, including rates, credit, equities, and money markets. It also provides pre-trade data and analytics, such as AI-Price, SNAP+, iNAV for ETFs, integrations, and LSEG market data; and trade execution comprising request-for-quote, request-for-market, request-for-stream, list trading, compression, blast all-to-all, click-to-trade, portfolio trading, session-based, central limit order book, bilateral firm streams, inventory-based, rematch, voice, futures vs. cash spreading, and dealer algorithmic suite. In addition, the company offers trade processing; and post-trade data, analytics, and reporting, which include transaction cost analysis, benchmark prices, and APA. It serves institutional, wholesale, retail, and corporate clients, such as asset managers, hedge funds, insurance companies, central banks, banks and dealers, proprietary trading firms, retail brokerage and financial advisory firms, regional dealers, and corporations. The company was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in New York, New York. Tradeweb Markets Inc. is a subsidiary of Refinitiv Parent Limited.","ceo_bio":"Mr. William E. Hult | CEO & Director | Age 55 | Compensation: $5.5M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $1.2M ranks in the top quartile among Financial Services peers, with revenue growing 18%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $679K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $62K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 4\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (5/10).","financial_summary":["Tradeweb Markets Inc. is a large-cap financial services business with a $27.5B market cap on $2.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +20% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +2.7pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at 11% against a 8% cost of capital, which means the business barely earns its keep economically.","The business throws off $1.1B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 55 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.44\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.8%, a thin return of capital, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 1.5\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Price sits 19% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.18849693807608722},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $9.3M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Significant goodwill (38% of assets) from past acquisitions \u2014 a soft asset a conservative appraisal discounts to zero","sev":"amber","cat":"balance_sheet"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 12% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Understanding Momentum Shifts in (TW)","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/12/Understanding_Momentum_Shifts_in_TW_112326102202_1795490522.html","date":"2026-11-24","timestamp":1795490522.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Liquidity Mapping Around (TW) Price Events","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/139/Liquidity_Mapping_Around_TW_Price_Events_111426120002_1794632402.html","date":"2026-11-14","timestamp":1794632402.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Taylor Wimpey (LON:TW) Shares Break Below 50 Day Moving Average \u2013 What\u2019s Next?","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/taylor-wimpey-lontw-shares-break-below-50-day-moving-average-whats-next.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794565285.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.84,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Here\u2019s How Much You Would Have Made Owning Tradeweb Markets Stock In The Last 10 Years","source":"benzinga.com","link":"https://www.benzinga.com/news/26/11/63296062/here-s-how-much-you-would-have-made-owning-tradeweb-markets-stock-last-10-years","date":"2026-11-16","timestamp":1794842115.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"CoreWeave bonds plunge as 2031 yield surges to 17.91%; Shares drop 10%","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/coreweave-bonds-plunge-2031-yield-160749981.html"